      "media_slot_id": "U2.still.profield-6",
      "heading": "4 · Role and constraint tools",
      "sentence": "Hats and cards stage a cognitive move — provocation first, selective follow-up second. English Six Hats page cites still open.",
      "quote": "Any tool should be useful in the expected way, but a truly great tool lends itself to uses you never expected.",
