      "media_slot_id": "U2.still.profield-2",
      "heading": "6 · Workshops are means, not genius",
      "sentence": "Fluency training supports practice; landmark ideas are rare — workshops train the hand, not replace genius myths.",
      "quote": "Artists are often portrayed in films and books as tortured geniuses. Starving, self-destructive, dancing on the brink of madness.",
